#ASSERT NOT (`s 7.1(1) the violation was accumulated in the 260 weeks before the initial claim` (YMD 2021 6 6) (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the violation was accumulated in the 260 weeks before the initial claim` (YMD 2021 6 8) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the violation was accumulated in the 260 weeks before the initial claim` (YMD 2026 5 31) (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 7.1(1) the violation was accumulated in the 260 weeks before the initial claim` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 7.1(1) the violation was accumulated in the 260 weeks before the initial claim` (YMD 2026 6 2) (YMD 2026 6 1))

