§ `s 7.1(1) the classes that raise the hours required (src:179, 196)`
-- Initial claim on 2026-06-01. A minor violation on 2025-01-10 counts; one on 2021-06-06 is outside the 260 weeks;
-- a serious one on 2024-02-02 that was already used in two earlier qualifying claims is spent (s 7.1(3)).
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the classes of the violations that raise the hours required` (LIST `ei1 Violation` OF `a minor violation`, (YMD 2025 1 10), 0) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS LIST `a minor violation`
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the classes of the violations that raise the hours required` (LIST `ei1 Violation` OF `a minor violation`, (YMD 2021 6 6), 0) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the classes of the violations that raise the hours required` (LIST `ei1 Violation` OF `a serious violation`, (YMD 2024 2 2), 2) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the classes of the violations that raise the hours required` (LIST `ei1 Violation` OF `a serious violation`, (YMD 2024 2 2), 1) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS LIST `a serious violation`
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the classes of the violations that raise the hours required` (LIST (`ei1 Violation` OF `a minor violation`, (YMD 2025 1 10), 0), (`ei1 Violation` OF `a serious violation`, (YMD 2024 2 2), 2)) (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS LIST `a minor violation`
#ASSERT `s 7.1(1) the classes of the violations that raise the hours required` EMPTY (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS EMPTY

