§ `s 8(7) the longest qualifying period (src:232)`
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the longest qualifying period after an extension, in weeks` EQUALS 104

§ `s 8 the qualifying period (src:216-232)`
-- Benefit period begins Sunday 2026-10-25. No extension: 2025-10-26 to 2026-10-24 (52 weeks).
-- args: first day of the benefit period, first day of an immediately preceding benefit period (if any), weeks under (2), weeks under (4)
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) NOTHING 0 0)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 26
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) NOTHING 0 0)'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2026 10 24
-- Three weeks proved under (2): 55 weeks back is Sunday 2025-10-05.
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) NOTHING 3 0)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 5
-- Two under (2) and one further under (4) are three weeks in all.
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) NOTHING 2 1)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 5
-- 52 weeks of extension reach the 104-week limit: 104 weeks back is Sunday 2024-10-27; 60 weeks proved cannot go further.
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) NOTHING 52 0)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2024 10 27
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) NOTHING 60 0)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2024 10 27
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) NOTHING 30 30)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2024 10 27
-- A preceding benefit period that began on Sunday 2026-01-04 makes paragraph (b) the shorter; the extension does not apply to it.
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 4)) 5 0)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 4
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 4)) 5 0)'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2026 10 24
-- A preceding benefit period that began more than 52 weeks earlier leaves paragraph (a), and the extension applies.
#ASSERT (`s 8 the qualifying period` (YMD 2026 10 25) (JUST (YMD 2025 10 19)) 3 0)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 5
